WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.093 --> 00:00:05.195
Cora thought hard.

2
00:00:05.196 --> 00:00:07.976
Where could she find a good shell?

3
00:00:07.977 --> 00:00:10.636
"Aha!" she said.

4
00:00:10.637 --> 00:00:14.446
"I saw lots of shells on the beach!"

5
00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:17.417
"Good idea!" Mo said.

6
00:00:17.418 --> 00:00:30.321
"Stay here," Cora said. "I'll be right back."

7
00:00:30.322 --> 00:00:37.186
Cora swam to the shore.

8
00:00:37.187 --> 00:00:43.901
There were lots of humans there.

9
00:00:43.902 --> 00:00:49.597
"I have to be very careful," Cora thought.

10
00:00:49.598 --> 00:00:53.674
Slowly she peeked out from the rocks.

11
00:00:53.675 --> 00:00:56.701
She saw shells.

12
00:00:56.702 --> 00:01:01.461
"There!" she thought.

13
00:01:01.462 --> 00:01:05.348
Cora crawled onto the sand.

14
00:01:05.349 --> 00:01:09.634
She moved toward the shells.

15
00:01:09.635 --> 00:01:13.271
Suddenly a shadow came close.

16
00:01:13.272 --> 00:01:15.891
A human!

17
00:01:15.892 --> 00:01:18.464
Cora quickly changed colors.

18
00:01:18.465 --> 00:01:21.276
She hid in some seaweed.

19
00:01:21.277 --> 00:01:24.471
The human went past!

20
00:01:24.472 --> 00:01:33.030
"Phew!" Cora thought. "That was close."

21
00:01:33.031 --> 00:01:35.724
Cora reached the shells.

22
00:01:35.725 --> 00:01:41.052
She checked each one carefully.

23
00:01:41.053 --> 00:01:47.514
"This one looks just right!" she thought.

24
00:01:47.515 --> 00:01:50.545
She zoomed back to Herbie.

25
00:01:50.546 --> 00:01:54.848
Herbie popped up. "You found a shell!"

26
00:01:54.849 --> 00:01:59.328
"Hurry!" Mo said. "The ray!"

27
00:01:59.329 --> 00:02:03.894
Herbie slid into the shell. "It fits."

28
00:02:03.895 --> 00:02:10.223
"Just in time," Mo said. "Everybody, hide!"

29
00:02:10.224 --> 00:02:13.645
The ray swam overhead.

30
00:02:13.646 --> 00:02:17.805
Cora watched with a smile.

31
00:02:17.806 --> 00:02:23.601
Herbie was safe below in his new home!

